+# Version Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Semantic Versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) for version numbers: MAJOR signals breaking changes, MINOR signals new features, and PATCH signals bug fixes. It was chosen because it gives consumers clearer signals about API compatibility and upgrade risk.
